sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Web app
  participant API as API Lambda
  participant PG as Postgres, pgmq agent_step
  participant R as Runner Lambda, jadwigo_runner
  participant M as Meta Muse, /v1/responses
  W->>API: POST a chat message, photos attached
  API->>PG: 1 transaction: message, run, pgmq.send
  API-->>W: 202, the message as sent
  API-)R: async invoke, live alias, 0 retries
  R->>PG: read agent_step
  R->>M: 1 step: the prompt and the lesson verbs
  M-->>R: verb calls, then words for the parent
  R->>PG: run events, fenced on the attempt
  R->>PG: archive the step
  W->>API: poll the conversation
  API-->>W: events folded into chat and lesson
